      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "越是在训练或比赛中努力奔跑，\n樱花千代王就越能感受到\n自己的身体出现异样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9ffcea50b07ec1661e920d67fce33e6d600a88adbd4aed35d26c3cced7734a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
