    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37cd39349a828c898b80d81d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她感到“樱花千代王”这副身体，\n正在开始一片片地碎裂──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f03914fee16652028f675e3b3d0052006a3b0391f03acd14c0ca16ae2112c86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f1bf03342850e30f2c06036",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8db4d00cbc9a3bb532b8dde",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是再继续奔跑下去，终究将被迫面对\n自己已经过了巅峰期要走下坡的事吧。\n然而她……尚未做好觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0598d737920b5dd4df66512c929ffe5e9dc1c42725a26703baf79e8d92e32c36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
