    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c4196fea416be972326c5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，丸善斯基则似乎是久违地\n在模拟赛上领先7身距获胜。\n媒体界也一阵骚动，认为传说即将复活。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a12a358200dd47ddcf305721fea4c0b80d6639e9fe5985ae96b1542a80c016fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d11706923cd480b91d6f822c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0787e6fd2a647395248e0c7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "崇拜的对象也正在努力遵守两人之间的约定。\n既然如此……自己只能继续加油了。\n樱花千代王的夏季集训就此展开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "854e18393a6587134c478532abf7fbc2f0e140642f434020f401e55640787863",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d15fe9e98aa20fdbb0bc48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:901351b80f34beefb78581fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6806421d48222b8fd1d000dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同期的武术少女・八重无敌表示\n为了身为恩师的祖父，\n她要站上比赛的舞台磨练自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d331f2203d5138851f8d97e3e3e93b36a863eb92ac3cd6ae966f91c689bd0092",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:207d095dd9d48ac52540b1f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40247449037346c3a947f303",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟英气凛然的她比起来，\n樱花千代王给人的印象就柔和许多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0979122773569a452dca482ce524bd097196c8a95096ff4ca2b4b68af9e37be0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf2254a28c272202e19c7650",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef3b2e0d42b3bbadf0e1a9aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过一旦聊起崇拜的丸善斯基跟\n梦想的德比，便会展露出惊人的霸气。\n就连八重无敌都不禁吃惊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97569e6c7a796ff474c6ebb85e7ea02c3066c105587f88beccff7199ed1a2bef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48e41a788cbc748af8e39759",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:887a64c34a83d0b6e8865ba2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对梦想绝不妥协的努力赛马娘──\n樱花千代王此刻即将挑战出道战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd99fbfc79ea5558f1eb42182914a616327ea2fe36132d16ba7d7f1ddec4e40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f6e269e7e92b88814f400c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ace06d06827dab9005eef86b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“朝日杯FS”当天。八重无敌前来观战，\n目的是为了观察未来极有可能\n成为自己劲敌的樱花千代王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd3225955352d84b421101ca8ed6f72a6d73eee495ba7ddbe2bb2e6da94d0b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7d4a5d02e0aaacb06a6221b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是祖父拯救了差点走上歪路的她。\n因此她想找到劲敌，好好磨练自己，\n增长实力，以报答祖父的恩情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "009b623186afaa6c4e63d085f3eab1c680b3e2318b1284b7b82bcb8ea0a55f95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d2fffbbb59b6df20f1e7535",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，目白阿尔丹似乎遭到医生\n禁止出门，无法到现场观战。\n……看来她的身体似乎非常脆弱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cc6c5beda0e7a1135565e2fea3072e2f8ce8256aac5085ce0bf6669166248c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9503546f43247d82c46db7e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此次能参赛丸善斯基曾优胜过的朝日杯FS，\n樱花千代王细细品味着个中滋味，\n走向了亮相圈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "368c34830c919935aab547eed5ab7920684696b50221d1e5e0708608302f69a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7deee84b7a9edddf064a2c9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向朝日杯FS",
      "source_fingerprint": "c58d0a8ed9da5f98ec7710e3088881050acc605b7600f6ec929511efc05e1d7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b6b98b98f64e96ca02a2fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面临“皋月赏”，\n樱花千代王露出紧张的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a887fad8e4438a0b7b760fd92443b86839cd1a77d494d66b4ff0fcf16843199b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b58784a28eece65cfc91183b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为这可是生涯仅限一次机会的比赛。\n而且在通往梦想的德比之路上，\n非得打倒不可的劲敌……今天也会参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b26cf225980762fada2ac67525b97ecf3244fc86ed6f30aa748c7de385ca2e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6bd01e936f345d59a6e2f9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌参赛是为了身为恩师的祖父，\n而樱花千代王则是为了崇拜的对象，\n两人皆朝向胜利迈步奔跑──",
      "source_fingerprint": "13500fd9e23df5acdd4925d667b5c2dcdb1c902067e4f92d336218310decc6ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
